# 统一按 LF 存储，检出时也保持 LF（项目里全是 .sh / .java / .xml，Linux 为主）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制，避免 git 试图做行尾转换而损坏文件
*.jar   binary
*.apk   binary
*.aab   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks   binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把 jar 排除出「语言」识别
libs/*.jar linguist-vendored
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar binary linguist-vendored

# 让 git diff / blame 更准确：这些是自动生成的
gradlew     linguist-generated
gradlew.bat linguist-generated
